l,"evidence":["1 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable)."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Confirm whether the $250 cap should be a configurable parameter or is intentionally a fixed one-shot experiment constant, and note the rationale.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["T5e"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["\"ledger.reserve(estimate_usd, cap_usd=250.0, reserve_usd=0.0)\"","\"halts FATALLY before the next criterion if it meets/exceeds cap_usd, so $250 bounds finalized spend\""],"finding":"The runner hardcodes an operational threshold `cap_usd=250.0` directly in the reserve call and the halt check, an integration-point constant the plan expects to bound a live experiment run.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f70506ec2eab74be4","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach → Budget enforcement","norm_id":"n5e640b97702ad8a1","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A future re-run against a larger candidate set or a costlier model class needs a different ceiling"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State how `estimate_usd` is derived per criterion (e.g. tier price × epochs × case count, or a fixed per-tier constant), so the pre-flight `reserve` is reproducible.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["E2"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.532,"drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["\"Before each criterion the run pre-flights ledger.reserve(estimate_usd, cap_usd=250.0, reserve_usd=0.0)\"","\"The estimate tier follows exec routing ... AGENT→criteria-eval-agent, else criteria-eval-cheap\"","Data-design ambiguity (signal 1/2): a referenced value (estimate_usd) with no stated computation/aggregation protocol"],"finding":"The pre-flight `ledger.reserve(estimate_usd, cap_usd=250.0, reserve_usd=0.0)` references `estimate_usd`, but the plan never states how that per-criterion dollar estimate is computed. It names the estimate TIER routing (AGENT→criteria-eval-agent else criteria-eval-cheap) but not how a tier maps to a USD figure the reserve consumes.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f7a87da2ec8108896","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach → Budget enforcement","norm_id":"n0acd09304734a45c","priority":0.268,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An executor must reserve budget but has no formula to turn the chosen model tier + epochs + case count into a dollar estimate"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a sentence: estimate_usd = per-tier unit price (criteria-eval-agent | criteria-eval-cheap) × epochs (3) × number of rehydrated cases for the criterion.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["prerequisite-consistency"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.369,"drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["prerequisite: reserve() decides refusal from estimate_usd against cap; finalize records ACTUAL usage","subject: 'then finalize()s priced ACTUAL usage. After each finalize the run re-reads cumulative spend and halts FATALLY before the next criterion if it meets/exceeds cap_usd, so $250 bounds finalized spend'"],"finding":"The subject plan calls reserve with reserve_usd=0.0 and states 'reserve_usd=0 ⇒ ceiling $250', treating cap_usd=250.0 as an absolute finalized-spend ceiling. But the prerequisite's ledger semantics gate reserve() on estimate_usd against (cap_usd - reserve_usd - spent), and the subject's own post-finalize cap-breach check re-reads cumulative spend against cap_usd. With reserve_usd=0.0, reserve() refuses a new estimate only when spent+estimate would exceed 250.0, which is consistent; however the subject relies on the post-finalize breach check to bound FINALIZED spend at 250, whereas reserve() only bounds ESTIMATED pre-flight spend. A single criterion's actual finalized spend can exceed its estimate and push cumulative finalized spend above 250 within one criterion, which reserve() cannot prevent — the '$250 bounds finalized spend' claim holds only across-criterion granularity, matching the prerequisite's per-file _spent_so_far summation.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f11e67795e88bbe7b","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Budget enforcement","norm_id":"n49a63715159febc5","priority":0.231,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"yes","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"low","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}}],"impact_model_version":"plan-v5","material_fingerprint":"1ea2a40472f86a91","